<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1140_3697.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser fründtlich unnd guotwillig dienst <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuovor</unclear>. Fürsichtigen
<lb n="2"/>Ersamen Weisen, besonders lieben unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guotten</unclear> fründt.
<lb n="3"/>Unnsers burgers <persName resp="#ner">Leonharten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Mayßlis</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eefraw</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zaigerin</unclear>
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diß</unclear> hatt unns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">heuet</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürpracht</unclear>. Wie das ain bader
<lb n="5"/>knecht, so sich <persName resp="#ner">Hanns Wilderer</persName> von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Sant Gallen</placeName> genent,
<lb n="6"/>ettliche jar allhie bey unnsern badern gedient. Unnd
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verschiner</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jaren</unclear> ain kind, dasselbig wochenlich umb
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fünffzehen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">krüzer</unclear> zuo underhalten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verdingt</unclear>.
<lb n="9"/>Unnd er darbey <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sovill</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lonß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uffgeschlagen</unclear>, das er ir biß
<lb n="10"/>in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fünffunndzwainzig</unclear> guldin schuldig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verpliben</unclear>,
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glichwol</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sy</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stätigs</unclear> der bezalung vertröst. Solcher
<lb n="12"/>baderknecht seye aber verschiner Somerzit von hin-
<lb n="13"/>nen hinweg gezogen unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürgeeben</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">welle</unclear> etwa
<lb n="14"/>ain monat oder zwen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ussbleiben</unclear>, unnd dann wider
<lb n="15"/>allher kommen, oder ir sonst weithern beschaid deß
<lb n="16"/>kindts halben zuoschriben. Er aber hierüber noch
<lb n="17"/>bisher außgepliben und ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nichtzit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuogeschri</unclear>-
<lb n="18"/>ben. Derohalben sy verschiner tagen verursacht wor-
<lb n="19"/>denn, das sy <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> kind zuo eüch gen Sant
<lb n="20"/>Gallen hinauß verfegt, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermaint</unclear> das kind
<lb n="21"/>Ime <persName resp="#ner">Wilderer</persName>, sover sy <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inne</unclear> alda betreffen, oder
<lb n="22"/>den seinigen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wa</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhanden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuozustellenn</unclear>,
<lb n="23"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ires</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußstandts</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zubegeren</unclear>. So habe aber
<lb n="24"/>sy <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inne</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wilderer</unclear></persName> nit funden, unnd auch das kind
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">niemandts</unclear> von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">annemmen</unclear> wellen. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jedoch</unclear>
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seye</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> dise vertröstung beschehen, wann
<lb n="27"/>sy <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glaubwürdigen</unclear> schein pringen, das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solchs</unclear>
<lb n="28"/>kind <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ime</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wilderer</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuogehörig</unclear>, wellenn ir alß
<lb n="29"/>dann von oberkait wegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürsechung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuon</unclear>, das es
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1140_3698.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="30"/>versorgt unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">versehn</unclear> werde. Unnd hierauff <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sy</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">May</unclear>-
<lb n="31"/>lin <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">underthänigclich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ersuocht</unclear>. Wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">welten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hye</unclear>-
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachbemeldte</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">burgere</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">so</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> kindts tauff
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">goette</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gottenen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seyen</unclear>, hierüber verhoeren. Unnd
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">iro</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alßdann</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">derselbigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußsagen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glaubwuerdigen</unclear>
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mittthailen</unclear>. Dieweyl dann <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sy</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Maylin</unclear></persName> unnd
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ire</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eewürt</unclear> baide <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guotte</unclear> arme <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">leüth</unclear> unnd nichts ha-
<lb n="37"/>benn, dann was <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sy</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">täglichen</unclear> mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">irer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">handarbaiten</unclear>
<lb n="38"/>zuo <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">irer</unclear> underhaltung bekommen mögen. Haben
<lb n="39"/>wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">iro</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">söllich</unclear> pitt nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verwaigeren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wellen</unclear>. Unnd
<lb n="40"/>darauff <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hyenachbemelte</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">burgere</unclear> hierüber
<lb n="41"/>wie <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gepürt</unclear> verhoert. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Welche</unclear> deponiert
<lb n="42"/>unnd gesagt habenn wie volgt.
<lb n="43"/><persName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Katharina <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Syezin</unclear></persName> maister <persName role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lienhart</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Weilandts</unclear></persName>
<lb n="44"/>stattschmidts <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haußfraw</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sagt</unclear>. Das <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> kindts vatter
<lb n="45"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hannß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wilderer</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bader</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">knecht</unclear> von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Sant Gallen</placeName>
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verschinen</unclear> jaren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erstlich</unclear> bey <persName resp="#ner">Christa Trautwein</persName>
<lb n="47"/>bader allhie gedient. Demnach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sye</unclear> er zum bader
<lb n="48"/>allhie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">im</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Grieß</unclear></placeName> kommen. Unnd alda auch
<lb n="49"/>ungefahr <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ain</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">halb</unclear> jar gewesen. Unnd darnach wider
