<lb n="59"/>das der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">baderknecht</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Hannß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Mildmer</unclear></persName>, so sich von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Sant
