<lb n="67"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> ain magdt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">neben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear>, mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">selbigen</unclear> er sich
